WEBVTT

00:02:28.716 --> 00:02:30.316
In the general population,

00:02:30.356 --> 00:02:33.236
the risk that a child will be born
with serious complications

00:02:33.236 --> 00:02:34.596
is three to four percent.

00:02:34.636 --> 00:02:36.356
With a first-cousin couple,

00:02:36.396 --> 00:02:40.436
the risk increased by 1.7 to 2.8
percentage points.

00:02:40.476 --> 00:02:41.636
And with those figures,

00:02:41.636 --> 00:02:44.556
the researchers concluded
that there was no biological reason

00:02:44.596 --> 00:02:46.316
to discourage cousins from marrying.

00:02:46.356 --> 00:02:48.076
Look, I totally get it.

00:02:48.116 --> 00:02:49.876
Whether you fancy your cousin or not,

00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:51.396
depending on where you're from,

00:02:51.436 --> 00:02:53.476
this can still be a bit
of a taboo subject.

00:02:53.476 --> 00:02:57.156
But the truth is, our feelings around it
are shaped by the culture we live in

00:02:57.196 --> 00:03:00.316
and not necessarily by whether
it's objectively dangerous or not.